[SIZE="4"][B]Device information[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*]Device: LG L50 (LG-D213), codename luv50ss
[*]SoC: MediaTek MT6572, Cortex-A7
[*]Display: 480x800
[*]Storage: eMMC (system mmcblk0p8, cache mmcblk0p9, data mmcblk0p10)
[*]Stock Android: 4.4.2 KitKat, firmware D21310c
[*]Kernel: stock LG Linux 3.4.67
[/LIST]

[SIZE="4"][B]Bug reports[/B][/SIZE]

Include your exact model and stock firmware, what you did, what happened, and [I]/tmp/recovery.log[/I] ([I]adb pull /tmp/recovery.log[/I]). Do not report issues from other L50 variants.

